    "ru": "Нейтральные компоненты SDK и окна ManyPlay ID.",
    "en": "Neutral UI components and window contracts with a fixed ManyPlay ID presentation."
  },
  "llmDescription": "Neutral UI components and window contracts with a fixed ManyPlay ID presentation. Game presentation is selected separately with a skin bundle.",
